WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:04.900
Everyone, the battle against 
the Great Devil Order is nigh!

00:04.900 --> 00:07.070
So let's put our spirit into it!

00:07.070 --> 00:08.850
Yeah!

00:11.730 --> 00:14.570
Now, let's commence the operation.

00:19.830 --> 00:23.750
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:19.830 --> 00:23.750
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:20.910 --> 00:23.750
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:20.910 --> 00:23.750
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:20.910 --> 00:23.750
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:46.160 --> 01:51.090
<b>Vitor the Resonance</b>

01:50.250 --> 01:53.090
It's protein cut with protein!

01:53.350 --> 01:59.050
Today we drink, drink, get drunk, drink, 
drink, and keep drinking until we pass out!

01:59.050 --> 02:02.310
Protein cut with protein 
is just plain protein.

02:02.310 --> 02:05.650
<i>I could take the life of 
this nation's king, Ranze,</i>

02:05.650 --> 02:08.450
<i>and gather despair for the 
Great Devil's resurrection.</i>

02:09.240 --> 02:10.400
<i>But, no!</i>

02:10.400 --> 02:12.260
<i>That would be meaningless!</i>

02:12.260 --> 02:13.400
<i>Pointless!</i>

02:15.060 --> 02:18.250
<i>Intolerable sloth in my own eyes!</i>

02:19.060 --> 02:22.140
<i>I can't restrain myself any longer!</i>

02:40.650 --> 02:42.970
What a pwetty night sky.

02:43.510 --> 02:45.010
Moments like this call for...

02:56.250 --> 03:00.650
<b>"The Murder of Pacifier Man"</b>

02:57.490 --> 03:00.260
"The Murder of Pacifier Man."

03:03.120 --> 03:04.990
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82

03:03.120 --> 03:04.990
Vitor

Perverted Gentleman

03:08.830 --> 03:10.750
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82

03:08.830 --> 03:10.750
Pacifier Man

Victim

03:10.750 --> 03:13.420
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82

03:10.750 --> 03:13.420
Guscle

Detective

03:10.750 --> 03:13.420
H-He's dead!

03:17.320 --> 03:18.610
Wait a moment!

03:19.510 --> 03:22.180
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82

03:19.510 --> 03:22.180
Eris

Guild Receptionist

03:19.830 --> 03:21.430
He has a pulse!

03:21.430 --> 03:22.180
He's still ali—

03:22.180 --> 03:23.610
I won't forgive them!

03:23.610 --> 03:26.490
They'll pay for killing this 
nameless, perverted side-character!

03:26.490 --> 03:28.250
I said he's alive!

03:28.570 --> 03:32.560
Wait, maybe the Great Devil 
Order is staging their atta—

03:32.770 --> 03:35.190
I will uncover the true 
culprit behind this crime!

03:35.540 --> 03:37.510
I swear on my muscles!

03:37.510 --> 03:38.730
When did you change?!

03:39.590 --> 03:40.580
Guscle-san.

03:40.580 --> 03:40.860
Oh?

03:40.860 --> 03:42.660
Let's begin our investigation.

03:43.120 --> 03:45.300
Oh! Vitor!

03:45.730 --> 03:47.350
That outfit!

03:47.350 --> 03:49.830
You get it, don't you?!

03:49.830 --> 03:52.810
No, no, it was the obvious thing to prepare.

03:52.810 --> 03:56.500
Oh, speaking of investigations... 
Here you go, Guscle-san.

03:57.960 --> 04:01.130
It's... protein and anpan!

04:01.460 --> 04:04.300
<i>He's getting this confused with a stakeout.</i>

04:04.730 --> 04:07.310
Those two pair so well that it's deadly.

04:07.310 --> 04:10.100
You're so considerate, Vitor!

04:15.300 --> 04:19.360
I believe this most likely was not 
the work of the Great Devil Order!

04:19.740 --> 04:22.020
What makes you say that?

04:22.020 --> 04:23.650
Hey, you guys!

04:23.650 --> 04:26.980
First, we go over the evidence at the scene!

04:26.980 --> 04:28.300
Vitor,

04:28.300 --> 04:30.830
what do you make of this baby bottle?

04:31.140 --> 04:32.750
May I?

04:40.850 --> 04:42.030
It's still warm!

04:42.570 --> 04:44.860
The estimated time of death is likely...

04:45.180 --> 04:48.930
sometime between now and last night, I think.

04:48.930 --> 04:50.770
I see!

04:50.770 --> 04:53.480
That doesn't tell us anything!

04:54.470 --> 05:00.310
Vitor, his fly remains down and unzipped.

05:00.310 --> 05:01.660
What do you make of that?

05:01.660 --> 05:03.690
That's perplexing.

05:03.690 --> 05:05.190
I believe...

05:05.190 --> 05:07.360
To be put in terms of muscles...

05:07.360 --> 05:11.160
This is the same as a sphincter 
being loose and inactive.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.080
Huh?

05:12.710 --> 05:14.550
I see! Brilliant anal-yzation!

05:14.550 --> 05:18.130
Oh! You understand, Vitor?!

05:18.130 --> 05:21.140
What is this crazy exchange?

05:26.800 --> 05:29.620
It's hard to find any leads here.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.910
Why don't we take a break for now?

05:31.910 --> 05:34.420
Yeah. Let's get something to drink...

05:34.420 --> 05:37.290
Oh! We have tea right here!

05:37.290 --> 05:38.230
Looks muscle good!

05:38.230 --> 05:39.360
Thank you so macho!

05:39.360 --> 05:41.740
Hey! That's evidence!

05:43.730 --> 05:46.450
Oh, da-macho!

05:46.450 --> 05:48.580
You muscle-brained pig!

05:51.080 --> 05:52.740
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82

05:51.080 --> 05:52.740
Trenchcoat Man

Suspect 1

05:53.080 --> 05:54.250
Confess!

05:57.420 --> 06:00.000
Hey! You would suspect an ally?!

06:00.000 --> 06:03.010
I don't really want to say this,

06:03.010 --> 06:06.290
but they say you should always suspect 
those close to the victim first.

06:06.730 --> 06:08.050
Please understand.

06:08.050 --> 06:10.810
You heard what Vitor said.

06:10.810 --> 06:12.220
Please forgive us.

06:12.220 --> 06:13.830
I'm innocent!

06:13.830 --> 06:17.010
I swear on these white briefs!

06:18.580 --> 06:20.330
What shockingly pure whiteness!

06:20.330 --> 06:22.560
Guess that means he's purely innocent!

06:23.060 --> 06:25.650
No, we still don't have proof.

06:30.130 --> 06:34.300
Ah, this soft, warm light!

06:34.300 --> 06:37.060
It washes my soul clean!

06:37.060 --> 06:41.150
The material is ordinary cotton 
and polyester, and yet...

06:41.150 --> 06:43.250
He's clearly pure white and innocent.

06:43.250 --> 06:45.370
Yeah, got it! Next!

06:45.370 --> 06:46.990
This is ridiculous.

06:46.990 --> 06:47.650
Muscle!

06:47.650 --> 06:49.880
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82

06:47.650 --> 06:49.880
Destroyer

Suspect 2

06:47.650 --> 06:49.880
I didn't do it!

06:51.570 --> 06:53.050
What is that?

06:53.570 --> 06:55.700
This is luminol.

06:55.700 --> 07:01.940
If this iron ball was used as the murder 
weapon, any blood on it will glow blue.

07:01.940 --> 07:04.170
Oh! I've seen that in action before!

07:04.170 --> 07:05.400
Let me see it!

07:09.110 --> 07:14.910
What?! My boomerang is glowing blue?!

07:14.910 --> 07:17.000
Guscle-san, please calm down!

07:17.000 --> 07:20.340
Which means the true culprit...

07:20.340 --> 07:21.810
was me all along?!

07:21.810 --> 07:23.040
...was me all along?!

07:23.040 --> 07:25.540
...was me all along?!

07:28.520 --> 07:30.830
Your boomerang was blue to begin with.

07:30.830 --> 07:34.780
Also, you're obviously not 
the culprit, Guscle-san.

07:34.780 --> 07:36.220
Vitor!

07:36.220 --> 07:38.890
No, friend!

07:39.960 --> 07:41.400
Muscle!

07:40.870 --> 07:44.560
m 0 0 l 228 0 l 228 82 l 0 82Wanna Do It

07:40.870 --> 07:44.560
Wanna Do It

Author?

07:41.400 --> 07:44.540
<i>Their useless investigation 
continued for a while after that.</i>

07:44.970 --> 07:47.980
Hey! Don't cut out our screen time!

07:51.450 --> 07:55.320
Pacifier Man's Grave

07:59.580 --> 08:01.660
Rest in peace.

08:01.660 --> 08:04.600
Hey! I told you, he isn't dead!

08:09.090 --> 08:12.510
H-He turned into a zombie?!

08:15.030 --> 08:17.170
I swept well!

08:17.170 --> 08:18.470
Oh!

08:18.470 --> 08:21.010
You're alive!

08:21.010 --> 08:23.350
Thank goodness!

08:23.350 --> 08:25.730
How can you say that after burying him?!

08:25.730 --> 08:27.220
What on earth?

08:27.560 --> 08:28.650
Huh?

08:28.650 --> 08:31.730
What's the matter, evewyone?

08:32.210 --> 08:34.910
What happened to you last night?

08:34.910 --> 08:37.320
Ah, well...

08:41.950 --> 08:44.410
What a pwetty night sky.

08:45.130 --> 08:46.660
Moments like this call for...

09:00.100 --> 09:02.020
That was it.

09:08.300 --> 09:10.380
What, that's all?

09:10.380 --> 09:12.110
Why, you!

09:12.110 --> 09:14.780
I almost drank that!

09:14.780 --> 09:16.610
So there we have it! That's...

09:16.610 --> 09:20.490
case closed!

09:20.490 --> 09:22.700
Yay!

09:24.610 --> 09:27.360
All right, now I want to take a bath!

09:27.360 --> 09:29.260
Let's all go bathe naked together!

09:29.260 --> 09:31.100
Yeah!

09:33.620 --> 09:34.940
Friend!

09:35.870 --> 09:38.700
Thanks to you, we resolved this quickly!

09:38.700 --> 09:40.470
You have my thanks.

09:40.920 --> 09:44.640
I'm honored to have been of service.

09:49.630 --> 09:51.980
All right! Let's meet up at the bath!

09:53.960 --> 09:55.650
<i>Now, how was he...</i>

09:55.940 --> 10:00.180
I believe this most likely was not 
the work of the Great Devil Order!

10:01.350 --> 10:05.260
<i>...able to immediately suggest it wasn't 
the work of the Great Devil Order?</i>

10:16.610 --> 10:17.930
I told everyone that

10:18.520 --> 10:23.620
the Demon Lord Army and the Wimberg Kingdom 
had successfully forged an alliance,

10:24.720 --> 10:29.980
and that we might end up fighting 
against the Great Devil Order.

10:31.910 --> 10:34.920
If it ever comes to that,

10:35.540 --> 10:39.710
I want you all to be able 
to protect yourselves.

10:40.110 --> 10:41.080
Got it?

10:41.450 --> 10:43.000
I'm entrusting this academy to you.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.210
Yes, sir!

11:07.870 --> 11:11.140
Everyone's meeting up at 
the bath, right, Vitor-san?

11:11.140 --> 11:12.220
Yes.

11:12.220 --> 11:15.180
I thought I'd work up a sweat beforehand.

11:15.740 --> 11:18.400
This isn't the way to the bath.

11:19.220 --> 11:20.320
Yes.

11:20.900 --> 11:22.240
But that's fine.

11:23.110 --> 11:24.910
What do you mean by that?

11:26.590 --> 11:29.770
I'm really starting to approach my limits.

11:29.770 --> 11:33.640
I'm aching and aching to beat you to death!

11:33.640 --> 11:35.960
You strong warrior!

11:36.870 --> 11:39.040
Now things make sense.

11:39.040 --> 11:41.880
That explains how you could 
tell from a glance back then.

11:42.360 --> 11:47.810
I have a guess I'm close to certain of, 
but who are you, really?

11:48.590 --> 11:52.810
A priest of the Great Devil Order, 
Vitor the Resonance!

11:52.810 --> 11:58.190
Your death knell will be 
a requiem for my soul.

11:59.440 --> 12:02.610
Please make this at least a little fun for me.

12:05.120 --> 12:07.180
Try some of this!

12:17.810 --> 12:21.130
You really just aren't enough.

12:22.050 --> 12:25.400
Thank you for our time 
together, short as it was.

12:25.800 --> 12:28.220
Farewell, Eris-san.

12:30.470 --> 12:32.520
What are you doing?

12:33.510 --> 12:37.440
I was just asking Eris-san for some practice.

12:37.440 --> 12:40.110
Tell me the truth.

12:42.530 --> 12:43.850
Good grief.

12:44.260 --> 12:46.790
I thought you were just 
a muscle-brained idiot,

12:46.790 --> 12:49.560
but your intuition is surprisingly sharp.

12:49.560 --> 12:52.450
Why, friend?

12:52.450 --> 12:53.570
Friend?

12:54.630 --> 12:55.830
Friend?!

12:57.960 --> 12:59.810
What do you mean, "friend"?

12:59.810 --> 13:04.820
You do realize you're the only 
one of us who's using that term?

13:05.180 --> 13:07.390
So truly worthless!

13:07.390 --> 13:10.280
I fight and kill the strong!

13:10.280 --> 13:15.280
I kill them as I watch them despair 
and lose the will to fight!

13:15.280 --> 13:17.310
That's all there is to it!

13:18.230 --> 13:20.520
That is everything!

13:24.940 --> 13:26.100
Guscle...

13:27.740 --> 13:30.150
Eris, you okay?

13:30.490 --> 13:33.350
My injury's not that bad.

13:33.350 --> 13:34.600
It's just...

13:34.910 --> 13:36.330
What?

13:37.140 --> 13:41.730
As a sadist, that was unbearable humiliation.

13:42.770 --> 13:44.550
Then leave the rest to me.

14:14.070 --> 14:17.960
Friend, I'll fight you at full strength.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.330
Here I go.

14:29.530 --> 14:31.340
<i>Ah, yes!</i>

14:32.440 --> 14:36.520
<i>All this time, I've lived 
such an unfulfilling life.</i>

14:36.520 --> 14:39.710
<i>Because I possessed such tremendous power,</i>

14:39.710 --> 14:43.950
<i>I faced the dilemma of never having an 
opponent I could go all-out against.</i>

14:45.400 --> 14:48.410
<i>But now... I've finally found one!</i>

14:48.410 --> 14:51.640
<i>This is the first promising 
opponent I've fought!</i>

14:51.640 --> 14:54.310
<i>This is the first time I've felt such fervor!</i>

14:54.310 --> 14:55.620
<i>I'm picking up speed!</i>

14:58.140 --> 15:01.190
You're the best, Guscle Clute!

15:10.050 --> 15:12.180
This isn't the best you've got.

15:14.900 --> 15:17.070
You should be able to feel it, too.

15:17.070 --> 15:19.900
This fervor communicated through our muscles!

15:19.900 --> 15:21.930
This ultimate exaltation!

15:23.400 --> 15:25.310
<i>Is that what this is?</i>

15:25.310 --> 15:27.960
<i>This feeling reverberating through my brain?!</i>

15:28.820 --> 15:32.490
Set yourself free, Vitor!

15:32.970 --> 15:35.110
I'm grateful to you.

15:35.110 --> 15:38.150
Thanks to you, I can wield my true power.

15:38.150 --> 15:39.310
Oh?

15:51.880 --> 15:53.620
You've unleashed it!

15:53.620 --> 15:55.550
The pathos of your muscles!

15:55.550 --> 15:58.840
My ability is called Resonance!

15:58.840 --> 16:03.230
It's a power that can return 
all of your attacks twofold.

16:03.230 --> 16:04.260
Oh?

16:04.600 --> 16:07.900
That's quite a nice muscle 
power you have there.

16:07.900 --> 16:10.460
I don't care about the Great Devil!

16:10.460 --> 16:12.360
What I want is...

16:12.360 --> 16:14.280
What I want is...

16:14.740 --> 16:19.540
To beat <i>you</i>, thoroughly, with my full power!

16:19.540 --> 16:23.080
That's what you want, too, isn't it?!

16:23.080 --> 16:25.250
Yeah!

16:25.250 --> 16:28.280
My muscles are screaming!

16:28.280 --> 16:31.420
My justice!

16:31.420 --> 16:35.250
My justice rebound!

16:38.810 --> 16:42.980
Is that the extent of your Resonance?!

16:47.900 --> 16:49.540
<i>This is awesome!</i>

16:50.030 --> 16:51.940
<i>This is awesome!</i>

16:51.940 --> 16:54.280
<i>This is awesome!</i>

17:01.350 --> 17:04.830
Come on, let's hurry up and continue.

17:07.250 --> 17:10.410
Is that all you have, too?!

17:10.410 --> 17:12.680
Come on, stand up!

17:14.590 --> 17:16.300
I'm not done yet!

17:16.300 --> 17:19.100
My muscles are telling me to have fun!

17:20.230 --> 17:21.390
What?!

17:22.770 --> 17:23.810
Here I come...

17:23.810 --> 17:26.540
Vitor the Resonance!

17:27.980 --> 17:30.690
Guscle!

17:50.120 --> 17:52.960
I'm still just getting started.

17:52.960 --> 17:54.220
How?!

17:54.220 --> 17:57.130
You should already be well past your limit!

17:57.830 --> 18:02.100
Friend, what sad muscles.

18:02.330 --> 18:06.140
You've honed your muscles 
to such a great extent...

18:09.100 --> 18:13.360
So why did you only pursue 
your own strength?!

18:18.040 --> 18:19.460
Can't you hear it?

18:19.820 --> 18:22.490
Your muscles are crying!

18:22.490 --> 18:24.530
What's going on?!

18:24.530 --> 18:26.910
My arm is snapping apart?!

18:30.260 --> 18:32.750
Why am I shaking?!

18:38.010 --> 18:39.410
What is this?!

18:39.410 --> 18:42.210
Why am I seeing this?!

18:46.850 --> 18:49.370
Consider this punch

18:49.370 --> 18:50.430
the grief felt by

18:50.900 --> 18:53.820
both me and your own muscles!

18:54.190 --> 18:56.530
This is the end!

19:15.130 --> 19:16.230
Friend...

19:18.930 --> 19:23.550
<i>For the first time in my life, 
I feel like I've lost.</i>

19:24.300 --> 19:29.270
<i>But oddly enough, that isn't a bad feeling.</i>

19:41.230 --> 19:42.510
<i>Guscle-san...</i>

19:43.930 --> 19:45.590
<i>If ever...</i>

19:46.220 --> 19:49.330
<i>we meet again, then...</i>

19:53.610 --> 19:55.960
Well, well, Vitor-san.

19:56.570 --> 20:00.060
It's rare to see you so beaten up.

20:00.060 --> 20:01.460
Jutis...

20:01.460 --> 20:03.830
I sincerely doubt it,

20:03.830 --> 20:08.390
but surely you didn't 
manage to lose, did you?

20:09.080 --> 20:11.580
Yes, I lost.

20:11.580 --> 20:13.570
For the first time ever.

20:13.570 --> 20:17.820
I never thought the day would come 
when I'd find someone stronger than me.

20:17.820 --> 20:19.130
Oh?

20:19.480 --> 20:24.430
However, I also feel like I'm actually 
alive for the first time in my life.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.570
Is that so?

20:26.570 --> 20:30.500
I suppose the taste of defeat 
is also quite delectable.

20:30.500 --> 20:32.440
I'm glad to hear that.

20:33.110 --> 20:38.420
It's great that you now understand 
you were but a big fish in a small pond.

20:38.420 --> 20:39.550
True.

20:39.550 --> 20:41.770
It's back to square one again.

20:42.140 --> 20:44.300
Next time, I'll win for sure.

20:44.300 --> 20:45.860
Is that so?

20:46.270 --> 20:49.100
Well, assuming there is a next time.

20:49.100 --> 20:50.220
What?

21:02.280 --> 21:04.740
My power is Ubiquity.

21:04.740 --> 21:09.790
It's the power to teleport across 
any space, dimension, or time.

21:14.200 --> 21:16.450
You said it, didn't you?!

21:16.850 --> 21:20.460
That you don't care about the Great Devil!

21:21.340 --> 21:24.840
Vitor-san, please rest in peace.

21:25.640 --> 21:30.100
Your death will also serve 
to nourish the Great Devil.

21:44.140 --> 21:45.870
Fall Disaster!

21:47.910 --> 21:49.620
Water Ball!

21:52.950 --> 21:56.230
What on earth is wrong with me?

23:35.820 --> 23:38.810
The truth behind the Fruit of 
Evolution is finally revealed,

23:38.810 --> 23:40.810
along with Destra's fierce past!

23:40.810 --> 23:43.260
The story finally approaches its final battle!

23:43.260 --> 23:45.550
Next time: "Destra the Absolute Death."

23:44.110 --> 23:46.440
<b>Next Time
Destra the Absolute Death</b>

23:45.550 --> 23:47.800
Destra... Are you...
